      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "skill_id": 51500,
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Moon waxing",
          "desc": "Every point of Chang'e's Magical Attack will increase her Max Mana by 1.5 points. 60% of the damage received will be borne by mana first, and every point of mana will resist 2 points of damage. The higher Chang'e's mana is, the higher the damage she will cause. When the mana is full, the damage can be increased by 100%.",
          "cd": "0",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Shield",
            "Damage",
            "Enhance"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/515/51500.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51501,
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Yue Chen",
          "desc": "Chang'e releases energy in the designated direction, causing 150/180/210/240/270/300 (+25% spell bonus) magic damage to the first target hit and marking the enemy for 3 seconds. It will cause an immobilization effect of 1 second. The immobilization duration will be affected by the spell strength. Every 100 points of spell intensity will cause an additional immobilization of 0.15 seconds, with a maximum immobilization effect of 2.5 seconds. After the hit, Chang'e's movement speed will be increased by 30% for 3 seconds. Chang'e's basic attack and skill damage can detonate the mark, causing 150/180/210/240/270/300 (+25% spell bonus) magic damage and 50% slowdown for 1 second to enemies within the range; Passive: Chang'e can easily induce the energy floating around her. , causing the normal attack to become magic damage, causing 80 points of magic damage. The range of the first basic attack every 5 seconds is increased and will cause an additional 80 (+10% magic bonus) points of magic damage and restore 5% of one's Max Mana.",
          "cd": "12/11.2/10.4/9.6/8.8/8.0",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Crowd Control",
            "Slow",
            "Speed Up"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/515/51510.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51502,
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Yuexuan",
          "desc": "Chang'e summons a mana vortex around her and at a designated location for 4 seconds. Each time she consumes 15/20/25/30/35/40 mana points from enemies within the range and restores 0.5~1% of her own Max Mana. It also restores an additional 20% of mana to minions and 50% to Jungle Creeps, causing 30/37/44/51/58/65 (+7% Magical Attack) magic damage. When the enemy has insufficient mana, the insufficient mana will be converted into equal spell damage (causing an additional 50% damage to minions, but not effective to Jungle Creeps).",
          "cd": "8",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Damage",
            "Recovery",
            "Mana Burn"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/515/51520.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51503,
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "Moonlight",
          "desc": "Chang'e releases the violent magic power to increase her movement speed by 30%, pours out her own mana crazily and randomly launches mana barrages around her. Each barrage consumes 48 mana points. Upgrade to increase the number of barrages per second (8/12/16), causing 100 spell damage to enemies hit.",
          "cd": "8",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Damage",
            "Speed Up",
            "Burst"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/515/51530.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51504,
